{"id":135219291837162,"type":"album","name":"Queen II","artist":"Queen","year":1974,"weight":20,"info":{"cover":"https://dn720307.ca.archive.org/0/items/mbid-a9fbbee6-63ce-4e28-aab8-cba325c7587d/mbid-a9fbbee6-63ce-4e28-aab8-cba325c7587d-21358289134.jpg","kind":"Album","tracks":11,"country":"GB","yt":"0aK4fZQfv7k","links":{"rateyourmusic":"https://rateyourmusic.com/release/album/queen/queen-ii"},"desc":"Queen II is the second album by English rock band Queen, originally released in 1974. It was recorded at Trident Studios, London, England in August 1973, and engineered by Mike Stone. The two sides of the original LP were labelled \"Side White\" and \"Side Black\" (instead of the conventional sides \"A\" and \"B\"), with corresponding photos of the band dressed in white or in black on either side of the record's label face. The album is also a loose concept album, with the white side having songs with a more emotional theme and the black side almost entirely about fantasy, ."},"artist_ref":{"id":162916649169545,"name":"Queen","info":{"img":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/Special:FilePath/Queen_A_Night_At_The_Opera_%281975_Elektra_publicity_photo_02%29.jpg?width=500"}},"labels":[],"genres":[{"id":185670346256268,"type":"genre","name":"rock","artist":null,"year":null,"weight":3782,"yt":null,"src":"musthear"},{"id":174164112458259,"type":"genre","name":"Heavy Metal","artist":null,"year":null,"weight":782,"yt":null,"src":"musthear"},{"id":109063683126539,"type":"genre","name":"Hard Rock","artist":null,"year":null,"weight":562,"yt":null,"src":"musthear"},{"id":191826593279813,"type":"genre","name":"Art Rock","artist":null,"year":null,"weight":531,"yt":null,"src":"musthear"},{"id":68128513346957,"type":"genre","name":"Glam Rock","artist":null,"year":null,"weight":463,"yt":null,"src":"musthear,rym"},{"id":138197775829889,"type":"genre","name":"Progressive Rock","artist":null,"year":null,"weight":439,"yt":null,"src":"musthear"},{"id":208928213731397,"type":"genre","name":